Marked as CRITICAL and NON-NEGOTIABLE\n  * Added ''When to Document'' with 7 mandatory situations\n  * Added ''What to Document'' checklist\n  * Added documentation checklist before every git commit\n  * Provided complete example documentation structure\n  * Shows real-world auth service documentation example\n\n- Enhanced Section 7: Master Reference Guide:\n  * References MASTER PROMPT section in implementation guide\n  * Lists all 7 core development principles\n  * Points to key sections (security, testing, verification)\n\n- Enhanced Section 8: Milestone Rules:\n  * Added 10-point checklist after milestones\n  * Emphasizes WEEK-X-PROGRESS.md updates FIRST\n  * Added ''before moving to next task'' checklist\n\n- Enhanced Section 9: Zero Tolerance:\n  * Added 14 specific forbidden patterns\n  * Added code examples of what NOT to do\n  * Includes security anti-patterns (weak hashing, long tokens)\n\n- Enhanced Summary:\n  * Added ''The 8 Commandments'' (added Documentation as #8)\n  * Expanded bullet points with specifics\n  * Added memorable quote about code/docs sync\n\nThis aligns MASTER-PROMPT.md with the enhanced implementation guide\nand ensures documentation is treated as a first-class requirement.","tree":{"sha":"6c4fb1705127b87ac3f9cbc91c5899cada76d712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/ai-chatbot-fullstack-comprehensive-2026/git/trees/6c4fb1705127b87ac3f9cbc91c5899cada76d712"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/ai-chatbot-fullstack-comprehensive-2026/git/commits/e6c1a82eb305f642b88d0b4d3f07c811ba3772cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com