://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/ai-chatbot-fullstack-comprehensive-2026/commits/6c411331c347588a17e12e82f095ce53d19ab866/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T11:34:20Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T11:34:20Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"docs: add comprehensive MASTER PROMPT section with implementation rules\n\n- Added critical MASTER PROMPT section at start of Part III\n- Documented 7 core development principles:\n  1. NX-FIRST: Always use Nx generators, never manual creation\n  2. CORRECTNESS: Test and verify after every step\n  3. COMPLETENESS: Zero placeholders, TODOs, or incomplete code\n  4. SECURITY: Best practices from day 1 (bcrypt, JWT, Zod, etc)\n  5. DRY: All shared code in libs/, no duplication\n  6. TESTING: >80% coverage, 250+ tests minimum\n  7. VERIFICATION: Build, lint, test before every commit\n\n- Added extensive DOCUMENTATION REQUIREMENTS section:\n  * Document at EVERY milestone (not optional)\n  * Detailed WEEK-X-PROGRESS.md structure template\n  * Example auth service documentation\n  * Documentation checklist before git commits\n  * When to document: after tasks, features, decisions, problems\n\n- Added quality standards:\n  * TypeScript strict mode configuration\n  * ESLint rules\n  * Code review checklist\n\n- Added verification checklists:\n  * Daily verification (end of each day)\n  * Phase completion verification\n  * Week completion verification\n\n- Emphasized documentation is as critical as code\n- All rules marked as non-negotiable\n- Added code examples for DO/DON''T patterns\n- Structured for AI assistants and human developers\n\nThis master prompt ensures consistency, quality, and completeness\nthroughout the 5-week implementation.","tree":{"sha":"23b4ca9ee08f556e037c9b6828600ef4d55cd333","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/ai-chatbot-fullstack-comprehensive-2026/git/trees/23b4ca9ee08f556e037c9b6828600ef4d55cd333"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/ai-chatbot-fullstack-comprehensive-2026/git/commits/6c411331c347588a17e12e82f095ce53d19ab866","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/ai-chatbot-fullstack-comprehensive-2026/commit/6c411331c347588a17e12e82f095ce53d19ab866","node_id":"C_kwDOQXVnEtoAKDZjNDExMzMxYzM0NzU4OGExN2UxMmU4MmYwOTVjZTUzZDE5YWI4NjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/ai-chatbot-fullstack-comprehensive-2026/commit/9ee685a1b8aa6506cf9b9c2d1d09a77fb285187e","sha":"9ee685a1b8aa6506cf9b9c2d1d09a77fb285187e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/ai-chatbot-fullstack-comprehensive-2026/commits/9ee685a1b8aa6506cf9b9c2d1d09a77fb285187e"}],"sha":"6c411331c347588a17e12e82f095ce53d19ab866","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/ai-chatbot-fullstack-comprehensive-2026/commits/6c411331c347588a17e12e82f095ce53d19ab866"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/ai-chatbot-fullstack-comprehensive-2026/commits/9ee685a1b8aa6506cf9b9c2d1d09a77fb285187e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T11:18:31Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T11:18:31Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"feat(auth-service): implement complete auth service with 5 REST endpoints\n\n- Generated auth-service with Nx (@nx/node:application)\n- Configured Express with helmet, cors, error handling\n- Initialized Prisma with PostgreSQL\n- Created User and Session models with migrations\n- Implemented 5 auth endpoints:\n  * POST /auth/register - User registration with bcrypt hashing\n  * POST /auth/login - Authentication with JWT tokens\n  * POST /auth/refresh - Token refresh with rotation\n  * GET /auth/me - Get current user (protected route)\n  * POST /auth/logout - Session invalidation\n- Added JWT utilities (access + refresh tokens)\n- Implemented auth middleware with token verification\n- Added Zod schema validation\n- Configured .env with DATABASE_URL and JWT secrets\n- All endpoints tested and working\n- Password security: bcrypt (12 rounds)\n- Token expiry: 15min (access), 7 days (refresh)\n- Session tracking: userAgent, ipAddress, expiry\n\nWeek 1 - Days 5-7 Complete","tree":{"sha":"48f657662f519a836835588802aa6f72c98c02e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/ai-chatbot-fullstack-comprehensive-2026/git/trees/48f657662f519a836835588802aa6f72c98c02e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/ai-chatbot-fullstack-comprehensive-2026/git/commits/9ee685a1b8aa6506cf9b9c2d1d09a77fb285187e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com