81a6872e2538a6bebbdb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-15T11:07:37Z","email":"98098891+Omoshlawi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Laurent Ouma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-15T11:07:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Ipd redesign (#1)\n\n* Implement Wards Line List feature with filters, metrics, and data table components\n\n* Enhance ward view with occupancy metrics, filters, and dynamic content switching\n\n* Add ward patients management features with tables for admitted, awaiting admission, and discharged patients\n\n* Refactor ward patients management components with enhanced state handling and UI updates\n\n* Enhance awaiting admission patients component with patient transfer and cancel admission functionalities\n\n* Enhance patient transfer and bed swap functionalities with new props for content switching and default transfer section to support both legacy implementation and current desighn\n\n* Refactor WardPatientWorkspaceProps by removing unused props and updating type definitions for better clarity and maintainability;implemeted discharge action for admitted patient\n\n* Overide community discharge functonality adding ability to fill IPD Discharge form before discharging patient from ward\n\n* Wired doctors note form for admited patients transitioning patient from admitted to discharge in\n\n* Implement pagination for admitted, awaiting admission, and discharge patients components; refactor table row mapping to use paginated results\n\n* Address PR Suggestions, clean code use config , Displaying dicharged patients\n\n* clean up discharged encounters types and restore ward-patient-time-on-ward to initial implementation","tree":{"sha":"b513f63e77891620f56439018af4dc1cff0ae1b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/njorocs/kenyaemr-esm-ward/git/trees/b513f63e77891620f56439018af4dc1cff0ae1b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/njorocs/kenyaemr-esm-ward/git/commits/8f7aafcd54167ca6831a81a6872e2538a6bebbdb","verification":{"payload":"tree b513f63e77891620f56439018af4dc1cff0ae1b2\nparent b922b67e9ef6bf31e03f9f6dbe840de6cc6b5dc8\nauthor Laurent Ouma <98098891+Omoshlawi@users.noreply.github.com> 1752577657 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1752577657 +0300\n\nIpd redesign (#1)\n\n* Implement Wards Line List feature with filters, metrics, and data table components\n\n* Enhance ward view with occupancy metrics, filters, and dynamic content switching\n\n* Add ward patients management features with tables for admitted, awaiting admission, and discharged patients\n\n* Refactor ward patients management components with enhanced state handling and UI updates\n\n* Enhance awaiting admission patients component with patient transfer and cancel admission functionalities\n\n* Enhance patient transfer and bed swap functionalities with new props for content switching and default transfer section to support both legacy implementation and current desighn\n\n* Refactor WardPatientWorkspaceProps by removing unused props and updating type definitions for better clarity and maintainability;implemeted discharge action for admitted patient\n\n* Overide community discharge functonality adding ability to fill IPD Discharge form before discharging patient from ward\n\n* Wired doctors note form for admited patients transitioning patient from admitted to discharge in\n\n* Implement pagination for admitted, awaiting admission, and discharge patients components; refactor table row mapping to use paginated results\n\n* Address PR Suggestions, clean code use config , Displaying dicharged patients\n\n* clean up discharged encounters types and restore ward-patient-time-on-ward to initial implementation","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJodjZ5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATZQQAJT8GowqKU+FRSaLkLJa2uCD\nSdWorAR3vswHDaAY9F2rvWJakzDSAhs+J6xeu0VONYDzJtGze4JkIoTqRoyyiZ72\n621evcFStnKD08xk0H6OPH5Cl2Ysf55iUYiZkITZ1vFCbN5ykwD44+i4xsNphFdC\nWtqB0v63HIcoskdKY3+y9gK2GAcj2TFK