commit: Complete Micro-Frontend POC with Angular 19 + Native Federation\n\nThis POC demonstrates a complete micro-frontend architecture with:\n\nFeatures:\n- Shell Application (Angular 19 + Native Federation) - Host app that dynamically loads MFEs\n- Manifest Service (Fastify) - Central registry for MFE configurations\n- 3 Micro-Frontends: Task Management, Workflow Builder, Analytics Dashboard\n- Separate repository architecture (not monorepo)\n- Comprehensive automation scripts (npm + shell scripts)\n- Complete documentation (README, Getting Started, POC Plan, Scripts Reference)\n\nTech Stack:\n- Angular 19.2.0 with Native Federation 20.1.6\n- Tailwind CSS 3.4.17 for rapid UI development\n- Fastify 5.2.0 for manifest service\n- Node.js 22.20.0 LTS\n- TypeScript 5.7.2\n- esbuild (default in Angular 19)\n\nScripts:\n- npm run fresh-start: One-command setup (clean + install + start)\n- npm start: Start all 5 services using concurrently\n- Individual scripts for clean, install, build per project\n- Shell scripts with separate log files\n\nReady to run: npm install && npm run fresh-start\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"057ce3cdf89251948bb61a1cfef860fe2b904a0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ayansasmal/mfe-nf-eco/git/trees/057ce3cdf89251948bb61a1cfef860fe2b904a0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ayansasmal/mfe-nf-eco/git/commits/66184bf6d9977cc4fcf5436e9e022303aec3bd56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13133411?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayansasmal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayansasmal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayansasmal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayansasmal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_u