 to opus\n- Fix security-reviewer model from Opus to opus (case normalization)\n- Add model: opus instruction to review.md dispatch step for Bedrock compatibility\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e26fbfa9d3c35430a0e726732422057a9703204d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scottyj503/ai-prompts/git/trees/e26fbfa9d3c35430a0e726732422057a9703204d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scottyj503/ai-prompts/git/commits/1415c2245bdf15a68d7e6b0c859c5af20b3608fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/scottyj503/ai-prompts/commit/1415c2245bdf15a68d7e6b0c859c5af20b3608fe","node_id":"C_kwDOQXsyI9oAKDE0MTVjMjI0NWJkZjE1YTY4ZDdlNmIwYzg1OWM1YWYyMGIzNjA4ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scottyj503/ai-prompts/commit/accca3b4047a7d875b11346726979aa08c307b46","sha":"accca3b4047a7d875b11346726979aa08c307b46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scottyj503/ai-prompts/commits/accca3b4047a7d875b11346726979aa08c307b46"}],"sha":"1415c2245bdf15a68d7e6b0c859c5af20b3608fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scottyj503/ai-prompts/commits/1415c2245bdf15a68d7e6b0c859c5af20b3608fe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scottyj503/ai-prompts/commits/accca3b4047a7d875b11346726979aa08c307b46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T17:45:48Z","email":"scottjones@Scott-Jones---0267---MacBook-Pro-14.local","name":"Scott Jones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T17:45:48Z","email":"scottjones@Scott-Jones---0267---MacBook-Pro-14.local","name":"Scott Jones"},"message":"Add v5.0: review pipeline, 4 new reviewer agents, and README update\n\nAdd /review command that orchestrates 5 parallel reviewers (functional,\nquality, performance, security, ADR) on a PR and submits an atomic\nGitHub review with inline comments. Add functional-reviewer,\nperformance-reviewer, lambda-performance-reviewer, and security-reviewer\nagents. Rewrite adr-compliance-reviewer to dynamically load ADRs from\nthe architecture-decisions repo. Update README with new agents, command,\nworkflows, and version history.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95e1d23776cca63efef92ba5b5e4f675c607c759","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scottyj503/ai-prompts/git/trees/95e1d23776cca63efef92ba5b5e4f675c607c759"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scottyj503/ai-prompts/git/commits/accca3b4047a7d875b11346726979aa08c307b46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/scottyj503/ai-prompts/commit/accca3b4047a7d875b11346726979aa08c307b46","node_id":"C_kwDOQXsyI9oAKGFjY2NhM2I0MDQ3YTdkODc1YjExMzQ2NzI2OTc5YWEwOGMzMDdiNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/scottyj503/ai-prompts/commit/d9d6266b9f867f530658dbf91b9698beed57a5b9","sha":"d9d6266b9f867f530658dbf91b9698beed57a5b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scottyj503/ai-prompts/commits/d9d6266b9f867f530658dbf91b9698beed57a5b9"}],"sha":"accca3b4047a7d875b11346726979aa08c307b46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scottyj503/ai-prompts/commits/accca3b4047a7d875b11346726979aa08c307b46"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scottyj503/ai-prompts/commits/d9d6266b9f867f530658dbf91b9698beed57a5b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T20:01:18Z","email":"scottjones@ScottJo267MBP14.lan","name":"Scott Jones"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T20:01:18Z","email":"scottjones@ScottJo267MBP14.lan","name":"Scott Jones"},"message":"Add v4.0: pipeline guide, 3 new agents, 11 new commands, and README update\n\nAdds PIPELINE-GUIDE.md for the 5-step feature analysis workflow, new\nqa-testing-agent, routing-agent, and terraform-agent, rewrites\njira-story-creator, and adds pipeline/utility slash commands. README\nupdated to document all ne