dConfiguration class to encapsulate Vite build settings.\n- Introduced ViteCommandBuilder for constructing Vite commands based on configurations.\n- Created ViteConfig task to define Vite build configurations with metadata.\n- Implemented ViteConfigDependencyResolver for resolving configuration dependencies and build order.\n- Added ViteConfigInfo class to hold configuration information for builds.\n- Developed ViteConfigurationResolver to handle multi-config scenarios and validation.\n- Introduced ViteModeResolver for resolving effective Vite modes across configurations.\n- Created ViteTaskFactory to enable namespaced Vite configuration syntax in MSBuild.\n- Updated project file for packaging and dependencies.","tree":{"sha":"d12476b742739bd5b05a53098c4e3f02de681ed4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DigitalParadox/ViteKit/git/trees/d12476b742739bd5b05a53098c4e3f02de681ed4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DigitalParadox/ViteKit/git/commits/b5f153809e72dfce378cef2ee907ceb3bcde811c","verification":{"payload":"tree d12476b742739bd5b05a53098c4e3f02de681ed4\nparent 8530ff05dcad8a9fb6859f651a57822f51e45d97\nauthor Chris McGrath <chris.mcgrath@redcross.ca> 1763987757 -0500\ncommitter Chris McGrath <chris.mcgrath@redcross.ca> 1763987757 -0500\n\nfeat: Implement ViteKit.MsBuild tasks for Vite configuration management\n\n- Added ViteBuildConfiguration class to encapsulate Vite build settings.\n- Introduced ViteCommandBuilder for constructing Vite commands based on configurations.\n- Created ViteConfig task to define Vite build configurations with metadata.\n- Implemented ViteConfigDependencyResolver for resolving configuration dependencies and build order.\n- Added ViteConfigInfo class to hold configuration information for builds.\n- Developed ViteConfigurationResolver to handle multi-config scenarios and validation.\n- Introduced ViteModeResolver for resolving effective Vite modes across configurations.\n- Created ViteTaskFactory to enable namespaced Vite configurati