ker2808/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/parker2808/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/parker2808","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parker2808/interview-senior-fe/commits/9541e519917eb88fd8e3b144d1b03ba2329acc2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:51:17Z","email":"38419968+parker2808@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Parker Vu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T12:51:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Live URL, share progress, cloud sync, and edit-mode passcode gate (#3)\n\n* Add live URL, fix plan doc links, and share progress without a backend\n\n- Document Netlify live demo in root and module READMEs\n- Convert bare documents/workspace/docs paths in plan content to working relative links\n- Route in-app markdown to plan docs or GitHub blob for shared KB\n- Progress: localStorage, ?share= bitmask links (view-only), public progress.json, export/import\n\nCo-authored-by: Parker Vu <parker2808@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add Netlify Functions + Blobs live progress sync\n\nPublic GET /api/progress and token-protected PUT for Parker’s published\nprogress; UI Cloud source with publish/load; document PROGRESS_WRITE_TOKEN.\n\nCo-authored-by: Parker Vu <parker2808@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add edit-mode passcode gate via Netlify Function\n\nFirst visit shows a modal; POST /api/auth/edit verifies EDIT_PASSCODE\nserver-side and returns a short-lived editToken. View mode locks\ncheckboxes and publish; progress writes accept editToken or\nPROGRESS_WRITE_TOKEN. Passcode never committed to the client or docs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Parker Vu <parker2808@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Parker Vu <parker2808@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"befe46f3f0e06afeba5693c758da96b569874c41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parker2808/interview-senior-fe/git/trees/befe46f3f0e06afeba5693c758da96b569874c41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/parker2808/interview-senior-fe/git/commits/9541e519917eb88fd8e3b144d1b03ba2329acc2c","verification":{"payload":"tree befe46f3f0e06afeba5693c758da96b569874c41\nparent f399b92daef658e09b98263689b94db744ec446f\nauthor Parker Vu <38419968+parker2808@users.noreply.github.com> 1790254277 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790254277 +0000\n\nLive URL, share progress, cloud sync, and edit-mode passcode gate (#3)\n\n* Add live URL, fix plan doc links, and share progress without a backend\n\n- Document Netlify live demo in root and module READMEs\n- Convert bare documents/workspace/docs paths in plan content to working relative links\n- Route in-app markdown to plan docs or GitHub blob for shared KB\n- Progress: localStorage, ?share= bitmask links (view-only), public progress.json, export/import\n\nCo-authored-by: Parker Vu <parker2808@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add Netlify Functions + Blobs live progress sync\n\nPublic GET /api/progress and token-protected PUT for Parker’s published\nprogress; UI Cloud source with publish/load; document PROGRESS_WRITE_TOKEN.\n\nCo-authored-by: Parker Vu <parker2808@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add edit-mode passcode gate via Netlify Function\n\nFirst visit shows a modal; POST /api/auth/edit verifies EDIT_PASSCODE\nserver-side and returns a short-lived editToken. View mode locks\ncheckboxes and publish; progress writes accept editToken or\nPROGRESS_WRITE_TOKEN. Passcode never committed to the client or docs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Parker Vu <parker2808@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Parker Vu <parker2808@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtRzFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsRoQAKbVwfj77IiKExpLzRgzFJ6N\n0Eb4xmFzbvkO14ZGPmS3z267IIAk28kjPY1KH5mz9lFdahAcc+Jc3LFglFj3a/Yf\nf5846u0cJl7le