/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7160\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7160</a></p>\n<h2>v7.15.1</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7151\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7151</a></p>\n<h2>v7.15.0</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7150\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7150</a></p>\n<h2>v7.14.2</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7142\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7142</a></p>\n<h2>v7.14.1</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7141\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7141</a></p>\n<h2>v7.14.0</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7140\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7140</a></p>\n<h2>v7.13.2</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7132\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7132</a></p>\n<h2>v7.13.1</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7131\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7131</a></p>\n<h2>v7.13.0</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7130\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7130</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/packages/react-router/CHANGELOG.md\">react-router''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v7.17.0</h2>\n<h3>Minor Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Ship a subset of the official documentation inside the\n<code>react-router</code> package (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15121\">#15121</a>)\n<ul>\n<li>Markdown docs are now available in\n<code>node_modules/react-router/docs</code>, letting AI coding agents\nand the React Router agent skills read official docs locally</li>\n<li>Excludes auto-generated API docs (<code>api/</code>),\n<code>community/</code> content, and tutorials\n(<code>tutorials/</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.16.0</h2>\n<h3>Minor Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Stabilize\n<code>future.unstable_trailingSlashAwareDataRequests</code> as\n<code>future.v8_trailingSlashAwareDataRequests</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15098\">#15098</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Disable manifest path when lazy route dicovery is disabled (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15068\">#15068</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fix browser URL creation to use the configured history window instead\nof the global window. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15066\">#15066</a>)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pass the history/router window through to\n<code>createBrowserURLImpl</code> so custom window contexts keep the\ncorrect URL origin.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fix <code>useNavigation()</code> return type to preserve\ndiscriminated union across navigation states (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15095\">#15095</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Widen <code>MetaDescriptor</code> <code>script:ld+json</code> type\nfrom <code>LdJsonObject</code> to <code>LdJsonObject |\nLdJsonObject[]</code> to permit multiple JSON-LD schemas in a single\n<code>&lt;script type=&quot;application/ld+json&quot;&gt;</code> tag\nemitted by <code>&lt;Meta /&gt;</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15082\">#15082</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.15.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Update router to operate on fetcher Maps in an immutable manner to\navoid delayed React renders from potentially reading an updated but not\nyet committed Map. This could result in brief flickers in some\nfetcher-driven optimistic UI scenarios. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15028\">#15028</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix <code>serverLoader()</code> returning stale SSR data when a\nclient navigation aborts pending hydration before the hydration\n<code>clientLoader</code> resolves (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15022\">#15022</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix <code>RouterProvider</code> <code>onError</code> callback not\nbeing called for synchronous initial loader errors in SPA mode (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15039\">#15039</a>)\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/14942\">#14942</a>)</li>\n<li>Memoize <code>useFetchers</code> to return a stable identity and\nonly change if fetchers changed (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15028\">#15028</a>)</li>\n<li>Internal refactor to consolidate mutation request detection through\nshared utility (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15033\">#15033</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Unstable Changes</h3>\n<p>⚠️ <em><a\nhref=\"https://reactrouter.com/community/api-development-strategy#unstable-flags\">Unstable\nfeatures</a> are not recommended for production use</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add a new <code>unstable_useRouterState()</code> hook that\nconsolidates access to active and pending router states (RFC: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/12358\">#12358</a>)\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15017\">#15017</a>)\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Data/Framework/RSC only — throws when used without a data router</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>This should allow you to consolidate usages of the following hooks\nwhich will likely be deprecated and removed in a future major\nversion</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>useLocation</code></li>\n<li><code>useSearchParams</code></li>\n<li><code>useParams</code></li>\n<li><code>useMatches</code></li>\n<li><code>useNavigationType</code></li>\n<li><code>useNavigation</code></li>\n</ul>\n<pre lang=\"ts\"><code></code></pre>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/195a0d03c1417127ccee73853058c8521beb4fce\"><code>195a0d0</code></a>\nRelease v7.17.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/15145\">#15145</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/963affeb924f2256bd20c0c5c87e4c4b4fcbd188\"><code>963affe</code></a>\nMerge branch ''main'' into release</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/97ef91d6f97e883d2d830fd1aef35ed3ae55e3a1\"><code>97ef91d</code></a>\nchore: format</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/c509c160d4258961ca0156ec083e35f3cf2bf97e\"><code>c509c16</code></a>\nPublish React Router docs in package (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/15121\">#15121</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/508d667460a3efd4b937cb67ca79494ea78960c4\"><code>508d667</code></a>\ndocs: fix documentation accuracy issues (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/15128\">#15128</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/4099277ed68056bf480a4e0988b5a3bc685538cd\"><code>4099277</code></a>\nchore: format</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/582035467f34645521a2b272c3ec52906a495da4\"><code>5820354</code></a>\nchore: format</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/8984d23f86ca7ae5655711744b77816090bda4e6\"><code>8984d23</code></a>\nRelease v7.16.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/15105\">#15105</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/d71025d9b86854180c995cb36fd3d28f58c459bf\"><code>d71025d</code></a>\nStabilize trailing slash aware data requests (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/15098\">#15098</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/6e21b638e1e692eaf19a8ff98ec05d28d5b23c70\"><code>6e21b63</code></a>\nfix: keep useNavigation() return type a discriminated union (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/15095\">#15095</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commits/react-router@7.17.0/packages/react-router\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `react-router-dom` from 7.12.0 to 7.17.0\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/packages/react-router-dom/CHANGELOG.md\">react-router-dom''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v7.17.0</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router@7.17.0\"><code>react-router@7.17.0</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.16.0</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove stale/invalid <code>unpkg</code> field from\n<code>package.json</code>. This was removed from other packages with the\nrelease of v7 but missed in the <code>react-router-dom</code> re-export\npackage (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15075\">#15075</a>)</li>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router@7.16.0\"><code>react-router@7.16.0</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.15.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router@7.15.1\"><code>react-router@7.15.1</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.15.0</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router@7.15.0\"><code>react-router@7.15.0</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.14.2</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router@7.14.2\"><code>react-router@7.14.2</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.14.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router@7.14.1\"><code>react-router@7.14.1</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.14.0</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><code>react-router@7.14.0</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/195a0d03c1417127ccee73853058c8521beb4fce\"><code>195a0d0</code></a>\nRelease v7.17.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/15145\">#15145</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/8984d23f86ca7ae5655711744b77816090bda4e6\"><code>8984d23</code></a>\nRelease v7.16.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/15105\">#15105</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/3ed77afcde0ad9aea79f1afe5f05a700b201f289\"><code>3ed77af</code></a>\nchore: format</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/e96962bc6159a2290632849b55872a3878753342\"><code>e96962b</code></a>\nfix: remove stale unpkg field from react-router-dom (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/15075\">#15075</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/587d08fca6ca61e00f44c1eda95bf6e6a9ab76ef\"><code>587d08f</code></a>\nRelease v7.15.1 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/15038\">#15038</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/97c8de79c38f107acd15f74d8295c7bf75894a5d\"><code>97c8de7</code></a>\nRelease v7.15.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/15018\">#15018</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/cf1d25003aa1217dc21c16e95d483601940ae9af\"><code>cf1d250</code></a>\nRelease v7.14.2 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/14993\">#14993</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/197674ba9fc1b72b452e17894e5e783bdab7a087\"><code>197674b</code></a>\nRelease 7.14.1 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/14973\">#14973</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/a87774f997d8ba497c97562840f0766250c3e4ce\"><code>a87774f</code></a>\nAdd new release process (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/14916\">#14916</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/e31077b0c380d9764dbced4c753e9ff99387045d\"><code>e31077b</code></a>\nchore: Update version for release (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/14945\">#14945</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commits/react-router-dom@7.17.0/packages/react-router-dom\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `react-router-dom` from 6.30.3 to 7.17.0\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/packages/react-router-dom/CHANGELOG.md\">react-router-dom''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v7.17.0</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router@7.17.0\"><code>react-router@7.17.0</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.16.0</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove stale/invalid <code>unpkg</code> field from\n<code>package.json</code>. This was removed from other packages with the\nrelease of v7 but missed in the <code>react-router-dom</code> re-export\npackage (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15075\">#15075</a>)</li>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router@7.16.0\"><code>react-router@7.16.0</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.15.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router@7.15.1\"><code>react-router@7.15.1</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.15.0</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router@7.15.0\"><code>react-router@7.15.0</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.14.2</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router@7.14.2\"><code>react-router@7.14.2</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.14.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases/tag/react-router@7.14.1\"><code>react-router@7.14.1</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.14.0</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies:\n<ul>\n<li><code>react-router@7.14.0</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/195a0d03c1417127ccee73853058c8521beb4fce\"><code>195a0d0</code></a>\nRelease v7.17.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/15145\">#15145</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/8984d23f86ca7ae5655711744b77816090bda4e6\"><code>8984d23</code></a>\nRelease v7.16.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/15105\">#15105</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/3ed77afcde0ad9aea79f1afe5f05a700b201f289\"><code>3ed77af</code></a>\nchore: format</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/e96962bc6159a2290632849b55872a3878753342\"><code>e96962b</code></a>\nfix: remove stale unpkg field from react-router-dom (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/15075\">#15075</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/587d08fca6ca61e00f44c1eda95bf6e6a9ab76ef\"><code>587d08f</code></a>\nRelease v7.15.1 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/15038\">#15038</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/97c8de79c38f107acd15f74d8295c7bf75894a5d\"><code>97c8de7</code></a>\nRelease v7.15.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/15018\">#15018</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/cf1d25003aa1217dc21c16e95d483601940ae9af\"><code>cf1d250</code></a>\nRelease v7.14.2 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/14993\">#14993</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/197674ba9fc1b72b452e17894e5e783bdab7a087\"><code>197674b</code></a>\nRelease 7.14.1 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/14973\">#14973</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/a87774f997d8ba497c97562840f0766250c3e4ce\"><code>a87774f</code></a>\nAdd new release process (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/14916\">#14916</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/e31077b0c380d9764dbced4c753e9ff99387045d\"><code>e31077b</code></a>\nchore: Update version for release (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom/issues/14945\">#14945</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commits/react-router-dom@7.17.0/packages/react-router-dom\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don''t\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\nYou can disable automated security fix PRs for this repo from the\n[Security Alerts\npage](https://github.com/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/network/alerts).\n\n</details>","tree":{"sha":"d02b622c9b1c51fa43b609bb761086a7fe455cb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/git/trees/d02b622c9b1c51fa43b609bb761086a7fe455cb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/git/commits/8690c276a2c5eb37a5ac3647d6e057129b584632","verification":{"payload":"tree d02b622c9b1c51fa43b609bb761086a7fe455cb8\nparent 7dccdb99d5a11384a4f622ae9f39a000045f05e3\nparent e7d8460b4e9e2b24bc047652b227c81708351ddb\nauthor OlivierD <olivedufort@gmail.com> 1784583836 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784583836 -0400\n\nBuild(deps): Bump react-router and react-router-dom in /frontend/les_constructions_dominic_cyr (#225)\n\nBumps\n[react-router](https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router)\nto 7.17.0 and updates ancestor dependencies\n[react-router](https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router)\nand\n[react-router-dom](https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router-dom).\nThese dependencies need to be updated together.\n\nUpdates `react-router` from 7.12.0 to 7.17.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/releases\">react-router''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v7.17.0</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7170\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7170</a></p>\n<h2>v7.16.0</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7160\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7160</a></p>\n<h2>v7.15.1</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7151\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7151</a></p>\n<h2>v7.15.0</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7150\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7150</a></p>\n<h2>v7.14.2</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7142\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7142</a></p>\n<h2>v7.14.1</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7141\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7141</a></p>\n<h2>v7.14.0</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7140\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7140</a></p>\n<h2>v7.13.2</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7132\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7132</a></p>\n<h2>v7.13.1</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7131\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7131</a></p>\n<h2>v7.13.0</h2>\n<p>See the changelog for release notes: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7130\">https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#v7130</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/blob/main/packages/react-router/CHANGELOG.md\">react-router''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v7.17.0</h2>\n<h3>Minor Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Ship a subset of the official documentation inside the\n<code>react-router</code> package (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15121\">#15121</a>)\n<ul>\n<li>Markdown docs are now available in\n<code>node_modules/react-router/docs</code>, letting AI coding agents\nand the React Router agent skills read official docs locally</li>\n<li>Excludes auto-generated API docs (<code>api/</code>),\n<code>community/</code> content, and tutorials\n(<code>tutorials/</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.16.0</h2>\n<h3>Minor Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Stabilize\n<code>future.unstable_trailingSlashAwareDataRequests</code> as\n<code>future.v8_trailingSlashAwareDataRequests</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15098\">#15098</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Disable manifest path when lazy route dicovery is disabled (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15068\">#15068</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fix browser URL creation to use the configured history window instead\nof the global window. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15066\">#15066</a>)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pass the history/router window through to\n<code>createBrowserURLImpl</code> so custom window contexts keep the\ncorrect URL origin.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fix <code>useNavigation()</code> return type to preserve\ndiscriminated union across navigation states (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15095\">#15095</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Widen <code>MetaDescriptor</code> <code>script:ld+json</code> type\nfrom <code>LdJsonObject</code> to <code>LdJsonObject |\nLdJsonObject[]</code> to permit multiple JSON-LD schemas in a single\n<code>&lt;script type=&quot;application/ld+json&quot;&gt;</code> tag\nemitted by <code>&lt;Meta /&gt;</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15082\">#15082</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v7.15.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Update router to operate on fetcher Maps in an immutable manner to\navoid delayed React renders from potentially reading an updated but not\nyet committed Map. This could result in brief flickers in some\nfetcher-driven optimistic UI scenarios. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15028\">#15028</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix <code>serverLoader()</code> returning stale SSR data when a\nclient navigation aborts pending hydration before the hydration\n<code>clientLoader</code> resolves (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15022\">#15022</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix <code>RouterProvider</code> <code>onError</code> callback not\nbeing called for synchronous initial loader errors in SPA mode (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15039\">#15039</a>)\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/14942\">#14942</a>)</li>\n<li>Memoize <code>useFetchers</code> to return a stable identity and\nonly change if fetchers changed (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15028\">#15028</a>)</li>\n<li>Internal refactor to consolidate mutation request detection through\nshared utility (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15033\">#15033</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Unstable Changes</h3>\n<p>⚠️ <em><a\nhref=\"https://reactrouter.com/community/api-development-strategy#unstable-flags\">Unstable\nfeatures</a> are not recommended for production use</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add a new <code>unstable_useRouterState()</code> hook that\nconsolidates access to active and pending router states (RFC: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/12358\">#12358</a>)\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/remix-run/react-router/pull/15017\">#15017</a>)\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Data/Framework/RSC only — throws when used without a data router</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>This should allow you to consolidate usages of the following hooks\nwhich will likely be deprecated and removed in a future major\nversion</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>useLocation</code></li>\n<li><code>useSearchParams</code></li>\n<li><code>useParams</code></li>\n<li><code>useMatches</code></li>\n<li><code>useNavigationType</code></li>\n<li><code>useNavigation</code></li>\n</ul>\n<pre lang=\"ts\"><code></code></pre>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/195a0d03c1417127ccee73853058c8521beb4fce\"><code>195a0d0</code></a>\nRelease v7.17.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/15145\">#15145</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/963affeb924f2256bd20c0c5c87e4c4b4fcbd188\"><code>963affe</code></a>\nMerge branch ''main'' into release</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/97ef91d6f97e883d2d830fd1aef35ed3ae55e3a1\"><code>97ef91d</code></a>\nchore: format</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/c509c160d4258961ca0156ec083e35f3cf2bf97e\"><code>c509c16</code></a>\nPublish React Router docs in package (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/15121\">#15121</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/508d667460a3efd4b937cb67ca79494ea78960c4\"><code>508d667</code></a>\ndocs: fix documentation accuracy issues (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/15128\">#15128</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/4099277ed68056bf480a4e0988b5a3bc685538cd\"><code>4099277</code></a>\nchore: format</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/582035467f34645521a2b272c3ec52906a495da4\"><code>5820354</code></a>\nchore: format</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/8984d23f86ca7ae5655711744b77816090bda4e6\"><code>8984d23</code></a>\nRelease v7.16.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/15105\">#15105</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/d71025d9b86854180c995cb36fd3d28f58c459bf\"><code>d71025d</code></a>\nStabilize trailing slash aware data requests (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/15098\">#15098</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commit/6e21b638e1e692eaf19a8ff98ec05d28d5b23c70\"><code>6e21b63</code></a>\nfix: keep useNavigation() return type a discriminated union (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/tree/HEAD/packages/react-router/issues/15095\">#15095</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/commits/react-router@7.17.0/packages/react-router\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `react-router-dom` from 7.12.0 to 7.17.0\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/remix-run/react-route