nstructions-Dominic-Cyr/commit/196feda6b60e247aba3c8523f333d55323ffbbb8","node_id":"C_kwDOQZGHK9oAKDE5NmZlZGE2YjYwZTI0N2FiYTNjODUyM2YzMzNkNTUzMjNmZmJiYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/commit/57b24abb279f6e45612ffee90f6d4e23ac33728b","sha":"57b24abb279f6e45612ffee90f6d4e23ac33728b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/commits/57b24abb279f6e45612ffee90f6d4e23ac33728b"}],"sha":"196feda6b60e247aba3c8523f333d55323ffbbb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/commits/196feda6b60e247aba3c8523f333d55323ffbbb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169318143?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivieriD/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivieriD/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivieriD/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivieriD/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/OlivieriD","id":169318143,"login":"OlivieriD","node_id":"U_kgDOCheW_w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivieriD/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivieriD/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivieriD/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivieriD/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivieriD/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlivieriD","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/commits/5882a06f980176221b12e278efc25c460ff59ba0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:14:05Z","email":"olivedufort@gmail.com","name":"OlivierD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T00:14:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Potential fix for code scanning alert no. 50: Disabled Spring CSRF protection (#217)\n\nPotential fix for\n[https://github.com/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/security/code-scanning/50](https://github.com/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/security/code-scanning/50)\n\nGeneral fix: do **not** globally disable CSRF. Keep CSRF enabled by\ndefault and explicitly exempt only endpoints that must not require CSRF\ntokens.\n\nBest minimal fix in the shown file:\n- In\n`src/main/java/com/ecp/les_constructions_dominic_cyr/backend/config/SecurityConfig.java`,\ninside `securityFilterChain(HttpSecurity http)`, replace:\n  - `.csrf(csrf -> csrf.disable())`\n- With a scoped ignore configuration, e.g.:\n- `.csrf(csrf -> csrf.ignoringRequestMatchers(\"/api/**\",\n\"/actuator/**\"))`\n\nThis preserves existing API behavior for your stateless REST endpoints\nwhile removing the dangerous global disable. No new imports or new\ndependencies are required.\n\n\n_Suggested fixes powered by Copilot Autofix. Review carefully before\nmerging._","tree":{"sha":"fc1fc0545dea058bcb362316b1747456de352787","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/git/trees/fc1fc0545dea058bcb362316b1747456de352787"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/git/commits/5882a06f980176221b12e278efc25c460ff59ba0","verification":{"payload":"tree fc1fc0545dea058bcb362316b1747456de352787\nparent 57b24abb279f6e45612ffee90f6d4e23ac33728b\nparent bef054b53a7ff180bea6a4638bcf3550b1e8bda3\nauthor OlivierD <olivedufort@gmail.com> 1778544845 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778544845 -0400\n\nPotential fix for code scanning alert no. 50: Disabled Spring CSRF protection (#217)\n\nPotential fix for\n[https://github.com/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/security/code-scanning/50](https://github.com/LCDCI/Les-Constructions-Dominic-Cyr/security/code-scanning/50)\n\nGeneral fix: do **not** globally disable CSRF. Keep CSRF enabled by\ndefault and explicitly exempt only endpoints that must not require CSRF\ntokens.\n\nBest minimal fix in the shown file:\n- In\n`src/main/java/com/ecp/les_constructions_dominic_cyr/backend/config/SecurityConfig.java`,\ninside `securityFilterChain(HttpSecurity http)`, replace:\n  - `.csrf(csrf -> csrf.disable())`\n- With a scoped ignore configuration, e.g.:\n- `.csrf(csrf -> csrf.ignoringRequestMatchers(\"/api/**\",\n\"/actuator/**\"))`\n\nThis preserves existing API behavior for your stateless REST endpoints\nwhile removing the dangerous global disable. No new imports or new\ndependencies are required.\n\n\n_Suggested fixes powered by Copilot Autofix. Review carefully before\nmerging._","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqAnDNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAo0kQAJQBrX8gtu+PyDM4wiTiWlFz\nFFSP4TSqAdloyR0ZfVpxoyqKck9E1a08987qrLHd8rQ+g17H8Nswwi954OFOvnxQ\nVN8JgoJyovoRiGzPXknUuBpsqCYsBkeD2JWfkWtiTpCakyME6KYYTKOvfwCtrPTV\nXcCuhOa+qrhL9rUVF+wIIXTkujSSgzQt0gicMpHGqWz5C0G/9WKCeM07OHJ1PgrO\nefn6pIRv9H6/iCE4AD1ZWM0cshbMM20zUG3ZDDfTtlvCmQ56Ju8MXx9c5Q8/xp0h\nuDn8ACIFF1A3whjWOb3MBK/2A6NGk6F66sTJ6RjwmAJVhm+3xScVtMSudNYng0/h\nfbWad63jr5Qb2Vne4GaJbLn3VzVIt7O9Rn+ql0+Z+ZQmwg3D57zxXOzbSChZc1ki\nVkz6biMGrP9TdgauMh68YjHCbegS6oOZHqIiYYkEgjxbpE/ah1sdUoxZGgXczJK3\nvzaQxiHjxjxeF6TvcDHhLQFO0KnM1zQffWAXETKbmnfwSBEaez/LyaWthzAx1BqV\n3YAxiZ6SGxmMY57XrNNFKwcwePr0k8BPHJbFtQcWPyx/CGFGlvIIltzOUrquWR4a\n7LP1VecjWJ84fFW33qDXZPU1EtTP4qn2Z1DsnbRW/Vgptys2mlQjOzQsu1wsL5ez\nmRZqd//o6giCyWFJy9hG\n=75dX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-12T00:14:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ